# The stacks themselves are hundreds of MB and stay out; the README describing
# them is project documentation and CLAUDE.md points at it, so it is tracked.
# Note the form: `test-data/*` rather than `test-data`, because git will not
# descend into an excluded directory and a negation could not reach inside one.
test-data/*
!test-data/README.md
target
.DS_Store
